--[[
    Memoriam configuration popup (TOR-539 / TOR-540).

    Draft lives in this module until Advance. Cancel / Main / Downtime leave the
    Play subphase unchanged. Advance prints the collected payload, then
    Phases.setPlaySubPhase(Memoriam). LUT / skybox / overlay remain TOR-101.

    Nested periods: shortest inclusive span wins each year; longer periods split
    into chunks. Idle strip uses four greys: two for base (non-nested) periods
    and two for overlapping/nested shorter periods, alternating within each pair.
    Periods that only share a boundary year are adjacent, not nested.
    Earliest years sit on the left; present sits on the right (slider 0 → 5000).
    Agent guidance: .dev/Phases/Phases Overview.md;
    C.getMemoriamSkyboxesForCharacter.
]]

